   "source": [
    "# Hema AI — 75k Parameter LLM Pretraining (Stage 1)\n",
    "This notebook trains the **75,000 parameter Transformer LLM** on a GPU (Google Colab T4 / A100 or Remote GPU).\n",
    "\n",
    "### Architecture Overview:\n",
    "- **Target Parameter Count**: ~76,576 parameters (~75k)\n",
    "- **Vocabulary Size**: 600 words\n",
    "- **Embedding Dimension**: 32\n",
    "- **Attention Heads**: 2\n",
    "- **Feed-Forward Hidden Dim**: 128 (4x ratio)\n",
    "- **Transformer Layers**: 3\n",
    "- **Max Sequence Length**: 256\n",
    "- **Stage**: Stage 1 Pretraining (unmasked next-token causal prediction)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Step 1: Verify GPU is active\n",
    "!nvidia-smi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Step 2: Clone repository & enter workspace\n",
    "import os\n",
    "if not os.path.exists('src/train.py'):\n",
    "    !git clone https://github.com/ambatitharunsai-tech/mini_llm.git\n",
    "    %cd mini_llm\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print('Already in workspace:', os.getcwd())"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Step 3: Install dependencies\n",
    "!pip install torch pandas numpy"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Step 4: Run Pretraining on GPU\n",
    "import os\n",
    "os.environ['MODEL_PROFILE'] = '75k'\n",
    "os.environ['TRAINING_STAGE'] = '1'\n",
    "os.environ['DATASET_PATH'] = 'data/train.csv'\n",
    "os.environ['EPOCHS'] = '50'\n",
    "\n",
    "!python3 src/train.py"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Step 5: Test inference with the newly trained 75k checkpoint\n",
    "!python3 src/generate.py \"What is machine learning\""
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Step 6: Download the trained checkpoint\n",
    "try:\n",
    "    from google.colab import files\n",
    "    files.download('models/pretrained.pth')\n",
    "except Exception as e:\n",
    "    print('Checkpoint saved at models/pretrained.pth')"
   ]
  }
